Ara\u00f1as. d.2 Physical Phenomenon: ANI1: Action of animals, rodents or birds (by direct contact or other). d.3 Reiteration: Reiteration Physical Phenomenon in the affected installation: This installation has not been affected by the same physical phenomenon, during the last 24 mobile months. Reiteration Physical Phenomenon in facilities of the same owner: Failures have occurred in installations of the same owner with the same physical phenomenon, during the last 24 mobile months. FALLA_ID NAME_FALLA DATE_FALLA ACTION","es":"Estudio para an\u00e1lisis de falla EAF 136/2025\n\u201cDesconexi\u00f3n forzada de la barra N\u00b03 66 kV de S/E Las Ara\u00f1as\u201d\nFecha de Emisi\u00f3n: 21/04/2025\n1. Descripci\u00f3n pormenorizada de la perturbaci\u00f3n\na. Fecha y Hora de la falla\nFecha 28/03/2025\nHora 07:06\nConsumos desconectados (MW) 5.86\nDemanda previa del sistema (MW) 9930.23\nPorcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n 0.059 %\nCalificaci\u00f3n Apag\u00f3n No aplica (porcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n < 10%)\nb. Identificaci\u00f3n instalaci\u00f3n afectada\nNombre de la instalaci\u00f3n S/E Las Ara\u00f1as / SE179T0058\nTipo de instalaci\u00f3n Subestaci\u00f3n\nTensi\u00f3n nominal 66 kV y 15 kV\nSegmento Transmisi\u00f3n zonal\nPropietario instalaci\u00f3n afectada CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A.\nRUT 77.465.741-K\nRepresentante Legal Iv\u00e1n Ar\u00edstides Quezada Escobar\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Presidente Riesco 5561, piso 17. Las Condes.\nc. Identificaci\u00f3n del elemento fallado\nNombre del elemento afectado Puente del pa\u00f1o BT3 de S/E Las Ara\u00f1as / PA019T0058SE179T0058\nPropietario elemento fallado CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A.\nRUT 77.465.741-K\nRepresentante Legal Iv\u00e1n Ar\u00edstides Quezada Escobar\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Presidente Riesco 5561, piso 17. Las Condes.\nd. Origen y causa de la falla\nSe produjo la desconexi\u00f3n forzada de la barra 66 kV N\u00b03 de S/E Las Ara\u00f1as, por operaci\u00f3n de\nprotecciones del pa\u00f1o B1, correspondiente al pa\u00f1o que vincula las barras 66 kV N\u00b01 y N\u00b03, ante una\nfalla en un conductor de un puente asociado al pa\u00f1o BT3.\nLa causa de la falla es atribuida a la contaminaci\u00f3n por excremento de ave en un puente ubicado\nentre el desconectador fusible del pa\u00f1o BT3 y el transformador N\u00b03 66/23 kV de S/E Las Ara\u00f1as.\nd.2 Fen\u00f3meno F\u00edsico:\nANI1: Acci\u00f3n de animales, roedores o p\u00e1jaros (por contacto directo u otro).\nd.3 Reiteraci\u00f3n:\nReiteraci\u00f3n Fen\u00f3meno F\u00edsico en la instalaci\u00f3n afectada: Esta instalaci\u00f3n no ha sido afectada por el\nmismo fen\u00f3meno f\u00edsico, durante los \u00falti","shown_language":"en","word_scores":[{"w":"failure","s":0.07},{"w":"eaf","s":0.04},{"w":"2025","s":-0.12},{"w":"forced","s":0.08},{"w":"disconnection","s":0.14},{"w":"bar","s":-0.24},{"w":"66","s":0.3},{"w":"kv","s":0.03},{"w":"las","s":-0.16},{"w":"date","s":-0.03},{"w":"21","s":-0.02},{"w":"2025","s":-0.12},{"w":"date","s":-0.03},{"w":"failure","s":0.07},{"w":"date","s":-0.03},{"w":"28","s":-0.09},{"w":"03","s":0.02},{"w":"2025","s":-0.12},{"w":"07","s":0.09},{"w":"06","s":0.03},{"w":"23","s":0.34}]},"predictions":{"conflux":{"pred":"transformer_fault","display_pred":"TRANSFORMER FAULT","probs":{"line_fault":0.228,"breaker_fault":0.0445,"transformer_fault":0.4345,"busbar_fault":0.293},"confidence":0.4345,"correct":false},"quorum":{"pred":"transformer_fault","display_pred":"TRANSFORMER FAULT","probs":{"line_fault":0.2769,"breaker_fault":0.2323,"transformer_fault":0.2781,"busbar_fault":0.2127},"confidence":0.2781,"correct":false},"nexus":{"pred":"transformer_fault","display_pred":"TRANSFORMER FAULT","probs":{"line_fault":0.2593,"breaker_fault":0.2231,"transformer_fault":0.3565,"busbar_fault":0.1612},"confidence":0.3565,"correct":false}},"explanations":{"conflux":{"method":"Exact Shapley (Modality) + Gradient Attribution (Within-Modality)","contrib":{"D":{"share":0.3189,"signed":-0.1624},"T":{"share":0.1916,"signe